  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid surge of private and institutional capital into AI drives increased use of leverage, repo and securities-financing against fixed-income collateral and funds, raising gross leverage and the risk of margin-driven unwind pressures in bond markets when positions are re-priced.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
