  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Intense, high‑visibility media coverage of a populist electoral surge amplifies market perceptions of imminent regional instability and potential supply disruptions, prompting speculative buying and short‑term upward pressure on oil spot prices.</data>
